// Inner agent API: /api/v1/dve/{dveId}/inner/{rest}
// Route to KNIRVGATEWAY as /api/agent/{dveId}/api/inner/{rest}
// so the gateway's dynamicAgentProxy forwards to the per-DVE socket.
